-**🇨🇳** 混响时间 $T_{60}$ 的盲估计在含噪条件下容易受到晚期混响尾掩蔽的影响。为此，我们提出一个多任务学习框架，以 $T_{60}$ 回归为主任务，以去噪重建为辅助任务，两个任务共享时频 Conformer 特征提取网络。去噪分支为共享网络提供逐时频点监督，$T_{60}$ 分支则通过 Fourier-KAN 回归头完成非线性读出。在覆盖仿真与真实房间脉冲响应、已见与未见噪声的四个测试集上，所提模型取得平均 RMSE 92.91 ms、MAE 56.68 ms 和 Pearson 相关系数 0.9625；与单任务基线相比，RMSE 降低 16.4%。梯度探针和表征分析表明，去噪辅助任务带来的增益主要来自共享特征的重塑，而不是两任务之间梯度冲突的缓解。Fourier-KAN 回归头在相同多任务设置下优于 MLP 回归头。
+# DACT-KAN：基于时频 Conformer 的去噪辅助盲混响时间估计
 
-**🇬🇧** Blind estimation of the reverberation time $T_{60}$ is vulnerable to masking of the weak late reverberation tail by additive noise. We propose a multi-task framework in which $T_{60}$ regression is the main task and denoising reconstruction is an auxiliary task, with both tasks sharing a time--frequency Conformer feature extractor. The denoising branch provides dense time--frequency supervision, while a Fourier-KAN regression head maps the shared features to $T_{60}$. On four noisy reverberant test sets covering simulated and measured room impulse responses with seen and unseen noise types, the proposed model attains an average RMSE of $92.91$ ms, MAE of $56.68$ ms and Pearson correlation of $0.9625$. Compared with the single-task baseline, RMSE is reduced by $16.4\%$. Gradient-probe and representation analyses indicate that the improvement is associated with denoising-induced reshaping of the shared features rather than mitigation of gradient conflict. Under the same multi-task setting, the Fourier-KAN head also outperforms an MLP head.
